{
  "bodyHash": "d2692c434e189a64",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC7sSiQ.png\" width=\"408\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><strong>Delightful</strong> 是 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 的附属模组，主打沉浸式与兼容性优先的内容。所有新增功能均可自定义。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/smore.png\" alt=\"S&#x27;more\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>食物：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/marshmallow_stick.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;棉花糖串</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cooked_marshmallow_stick.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;烤棉花糖串</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/smore.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;烤棉花糖巧克力三明治</strong>（推荐搭配&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">那不勒斯</a>&nbsp;或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力</a>&nbsp;的巧克力）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/sinigang.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>酸汤</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cheeseburger.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;芝士汉堡</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/deluxe_cheeseburger.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;豪华芝士汉堡</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/jelly_bottle.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;果酱瓶</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/glow_jelly_bottle.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;荧光果酱瓶</strong>（发光效果）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nut_butter_bottle.png\" alt=\"Nut Butter Bottle\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;坚果酱瓶</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nut_butter_and_jelly_sandwich.png\" alt=\"Nut Butter and Jelly Sandwich\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;坚果果酱三明治</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/ender_nectar.png\" alt=\"Ender Nectar\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;末影蜜露</strong>（单次使用末影箱访问权限）<strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cactus_flesh.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>仙人掌肉</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cactus_steak.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;仙人掌排</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/field_salad.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;田野沙拉</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/acorn.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;橡子</strong>（从橡木树叶掉落）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/rock_candy.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>&nbsp;冰糖</strong>（用于 \"forge:gems/rose_quartz\"，推荐搭配&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力</a>&nbsp;或&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">丰饶生物群系</a></strong>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/raw_goat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>生山羊肉</strong>&nbsp;（山羊掉落）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cooked_goat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>熟山羊肉</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/venison_chops.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;生鹿肉排</strong>（用于 \"forge:raw_venison\"，推荐搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/naturalist\" rel=\"nofollow\">自然主义</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cooked_venison_chops.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>熟鹿肉排</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cantaloupe_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;哈密瓜片</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/InventivetalentDev/minecraft-assets/1.19.2/assets/minecraft/textures/item/pumpkin_pie.png\">&nbsp;南瓜派重制</strong>（可配置）：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/pumpkin_pie_top.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;你现在可以在世界中放置原版南瓜派，就像放置《丰收季》的派一样！</p>\n<p>切割派块可获得&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/pumpkin_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;南瓜派切片</strong>，或直接右键食用。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/copper_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>刀具</strong><strong>:</strong></span></p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><em>必须在 \"config/delightful-common.toml\" 配置文件中启用刀具。</em></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/copper_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 铜刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/bone_knife.png\" alt=\"骨刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;骨刀</strong>（推荐搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">骨装备</a>）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/amethyst_knife.png\" alt=\"紫水晶刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;紫水晶刀</strong>（推荐搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">紫水晶装备</a>）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/emerald_knife.png\" alt=\"绿宝石刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;绿宝石刀</strong>（推荐搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-emerald-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">绿宝石装备</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>兼容刀具</strong>&nbsp;（标签）<strong>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/tin_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong><strong> 锡刀</strong> (forge:ingots/tin)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/steel_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;钢刀</strong> (forge:ingots/steel)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/bronze_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;青铜刀</strong> (forge:ingots/bronze)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/silver_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;银刀</strong> (forge:ingots/silver)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/brass_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;黄铜刀</strong> (forge:ingots/brass)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/enderite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;末影合金刀&nbsp;</strong>(forge:ingots/enderite)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/black_opal_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;黑欧泊刀</strong>&nbsp;(forge:gems/black_opal)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/constantan_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;康斯坦丁刀</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/constantan)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/electrum_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;琥珀金刀</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/electrum)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/invar_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;恒钢刀</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/invar)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/lead_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;铅刀</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/lead)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nickel_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;镍刀</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/nickel)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/zinc_knife.png\" alt=\"锌刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;锌刀</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/zinc)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适用于&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">天界 (The Aether)</a> 及插件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/skyroot_knife.png\">&nbsp;<strong>天界木刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/holystone_knife.png\">&nbsp;白垩石刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/zanite_knife.png\">&nbsp;赞尼特刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/gravitite_knife.png\">&nbsp;重力石刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/skyjade_knife.png\">&nbsp;天界玉刀</strong>（适用于<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">深渊天界</a></strong>）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/stratus_knife.png\">&nbsp;层云刀</strong>（适用于<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">深渊天界</a></strong>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/veridium_knife.png\">&nbsp;<strong>维里迪乌姆刀</strong>（适用于<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">天界：重制版</a></strong>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/infused_veridium_knife.png\">&nbsp;<strong>附魔维里迪乌姆刀</strong>（适用于<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">天界：重制版</a></strong>）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适用于&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮色森林</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/fiery_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;烈焰刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/ironwood_knife.png\">&nbsp;铁木刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/knightmetal_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;骑士金属刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/steeleaf_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;钢叶刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适用于&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">幽暗地底</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cloggrum_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"克拉古姆刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;克拉古姆刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/forgotten_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"遗忘刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;遗忘刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/froststeel_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"霜钢刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;霜钢刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/utherium_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"乌瑟瑞姆刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;乌瑟瑞姆刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适用于&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">通用机械工具</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/osmium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;锇刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/lapis_lazuli_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;青金石刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/refined_glowstone_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;精炼荧石刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/refined_obsidian_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;精炼黑曜石刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适用于&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">植物魔法</a>&nbsp;和&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicbotany\" rel=\"nofollow\">神话植物魔法</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/elementium_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"元素金属刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;元素金属刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/manasteel_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"曼钢刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;曼钢刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/terra_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"大地之刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;大地之刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/alf_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"精灵刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;精灵刀</strong>（适用于<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicbotany\" rel=\"nofollow\">神话植物魔法</a></strong>）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适用于&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\">禁忌与神秘术</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/deorum_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> 德奥鲁姆刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/reinforced_deorum_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;强化德奥鲁姆刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/draco_arcanus_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;龙语神秘刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适用于&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力附加物品</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/gilded_quartz_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></a><strong> 镀金石英刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/experience_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;经验刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/blazing_knife.png\" alt=\"烈焰刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></a>烈焰刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适用于&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simpleores\" rel=\"nofollow\">简易矿石</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/adamantium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp; adamantium刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/mythril_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;秘银刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/onyx_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;缟玛瑙刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适用于&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion\" rel=\"nofollow\">聚变科技</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/thyrium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;钛铀刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/sinisite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;辛硅石刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适用于&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-additions-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多附加</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/rose_gold_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"玫瑰金刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;玫瑰金刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/gilded_netherite_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"镀金下界合金刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;镀金下界合金刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适用于&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phantasm\" rel=\"nofollow\">末影幻象</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/crystalline_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;结晶刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/stellium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;星辉刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适用于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ores-above-diamonds\" rel=\"nofollow\">钻石之上矿石</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/amethyst_knife.png\">&nbsp;紫水晶刀</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/netherite_opal_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;下界合金欧泊刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>独立刀具：</strong><strong><br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/adamantite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp; adamantite刀</strong>（适用于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enlightend\" rel=\"nofollow\">启蒙 (Enlightend)</a>）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/living_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;生命刀</strong>（适用于<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roots-classic\" rel=\"nofollow\">根源经典</a></strong>）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/warden_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;监守者刀</strong>（适用于<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">更深更暗</a></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">）</a></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/obsidian_infused_enderite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;黑曜石附魔末影合金刀</strong>（适用于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-lieonlion\" rel=\"nofollow\">莱昂狮的末影合金</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tgwrFK3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> 灵魂钢刀</strong>&nbsp;（适用于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spirit\" rel=\"nofollow\">灵体 (Spirit)</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/necronium_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"死灵金属刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> 死灵金属刀</strong>（适用于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phantasmic\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻象 (Phantasmic)</a>）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/allthemodium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;全金属刀</strong>（适用于<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allthemodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">全金属</a></strong>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/leaf_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> 树叶刀</strong>（适用于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seeds\" rel=\"nofollow\">种子</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/kiwano_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> 刺角瓜刀</strong>（适用于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\">下界异闻</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberries.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>鲑莓 (Salmonberries)</strong><strong>:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberries.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鲑莓</strong>是一种美味的新型浆果，生成于森林中。它们适合作为便携零食，或用于需要浆果的食谱，例如<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/berry_matcha_latte.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;浆果抹茶拿铁</strong>。</p>\n<p>它们是特殊食材，可用于制作&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_pie.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>鲑莓派</strong>（可切分为&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;派块）以及&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_ice_cream.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>鲑莓冰淇淋</strong>（推荐搭配&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">那不勒斯冰淇淋</a>模组）。</p>\n<p>这些浆果可以合成为&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_pips.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>鲑莓种子</strong>并进行种植（灵感来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berry-good\" rel=\"nofollow\">浆果好时光</a>模组）。</p>\n<p>不过，<strong>鲑莓灌木</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">需要雨水和光照</span>才能快速生长。</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/salmonberry_sack.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鲑莓袋</strong>是用于存放和装饰浆果的方块（灵感来自&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇物</a>模组）。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>抹茶 (Matcha)</strong><strong>:</strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/green_tea_leaf.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;绿茶树叶</strong>&nbsp;可通过使用刀右键击树叶方块随机获得。来自&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-respite\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫小憩</a>&nbsp;模组的绿茶树叶兼容且推荐使用。</p>\n<p>将它们放入锅中烹煮即可制成&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;抹茶粉</strong>（浓缩茶粉）。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>随后可用于制作两款带有增益效果的可口拿铁：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha_latte.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;抹茶拿铁</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/berry_matcha_latte.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;浆果抹茶拿铁</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha_ice_cream.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;抹茶冰淇淋</strong>（推荐搭配&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">那不勒斯冰淇淋</a>模组）</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/animal_fat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;油脂与动物油：</span><br></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/animal_fat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>动物脂肪</strong>有几率从任何“多脂”动物（标签为\"delightful:fatty_animals\"）身上掉落，部分模组已提供支持。</p>\n<p>将脂肪放入锅中可熬制为&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/animal_oil_bottle.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>动物油瓶</strong>，它是一种熔炉燃料并具备特殊功能：只需简单的潜行右键点击即可瞬间为熔炉补充燃料。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/basalt_cabinet_front.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></span>&nbsp;新增方块：<br></strong></span></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/acorn_sack.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>&nbsp;橡实袋</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eVJANTM.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;迷你西瓜</strong>（在平原生物群系生成）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/cantaloupe_side_small.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;哈密瓜</strong>&nbsp;（在海滩生物群系生成）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/quartz_cabinet_front.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> &nbsp;石英柜</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/basalt_cabinet_front.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> &nbsp;玄武岩柜</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/246/22/637155296232619409.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<strong>适配&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a>：</strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/blueberry_pie.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/green_apple_pie.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/nightshade_berry_pie.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/crimson_berry_pie.png\">&nbsp;派系统改 (Pie Overhaul)</strong>（禁用任意派块物品即可关闭）：</p>\n<p>（推荐搭配&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pie-overhaul-delightful-retextured\" rel=\"nofollow\">派系统改</a>&nbsp;材质包）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/blueberry_pie_top.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/green_apple_pie_top.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/nightshade_berry_pie_top.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/crimson_berry_pie_top.png\">&nbsp;你现在可以将任何 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</span> 模组中的派像 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">农夫乐事</span>&nbsp;模组中的派一样放置在世界中！</p>\n<p>切割该派可获得&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/blueberry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/green_apple_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nightshade_berry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/crimson_berry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;派块</strong>，或直接右键食用。该派提供的药水效果与之前相同。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/565/915/637924211543296813.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>适配&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a>：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/baileyholl/Ars-Nouveau/1.19.x/src/main/resources/assets/ars_nouveau/textures/items/source_berry_pie.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;源浆派系统改 (Source Berry Pie Overhaul)</strong>（禁用派块物品即可关闭）：</p>\n<p>（推荐搭配&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pie-overhaul-delightful-retextured\" rel=\"nofollow\">派系统改</a>&nbsp;材质包）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/source_berry_pie_top.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;你现在可以将一个 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Ars Nouveau</span> 模组的源浆派像 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">农夫乐事</span>&nbsp;模组中的派一样放置在世界中！</p>\n<p>切割该派可获得&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/source_berry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;源浆派块</strong>，或直接右键食用。该派提供的药水效果与之前相同。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/field_salad.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>适配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></strong><strong>：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/chopped_clover.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;切碎的车轴草</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/lavender_tea.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;薰衣草茶</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/483/128/637782721029825410.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>适配 </strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecologics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecologics</a></strong><strong>：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/coconut_curry.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>椰香咖喱</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/honey_glazed_walnut.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;蜂蜜烤核桃</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/prickly_pear_juice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;仙人掌果汁</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/azalea_tea.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;杜鹃花茶</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
